# The rule for this file:
#
#   Ignore ONLY what a fresh clone can regenerate for itself.
#
# Everything needed to run the project on another machine is committed —
# all source, package.json AND package-lock.json, and every config file
# (tsconfig, electron.vite.config, vitest.config, electron-builder.yml).
# A clean checkout needs nothing but:
#
#   npm ci && npm run dev
#
# There are no runtime art or audio assets to fetch: every 3D object is
# generated in code and every sound is synthesised at runtime.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Regenerated by `npm ci` / `npm install`
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.npm/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Regenerated by `npm run build` / `npm run dist`
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
out/
dist/
release/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test and lint artefacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
coverage/
.eslintcache

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets. Nothing here yet — but code-signing certificates arrive with
# packaging, and a leaked .pfx cannot be un-leaked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pfx
*.p12
*.pem
*.key
*.cer

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Concept art and art sources.
#
# The character sheets are Miguel's work and are not ours to redistribute;
# keep them locally in characters/ as the design reference. Art sources are
# large binaries that belong in dedicated asset storage or Git LFS, not in
# ordinary history.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
characters/
art/**/*.blend
art/**/*.blend1
art/**/*.psd
art/**/*.spp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Private working notes — plans and assistant context, not shipped docs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
CLAUDE.md
doc/PROJECT_PLAN.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.local
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
